Hello, 
 I don't have the full list of factors, but the most important would be driver historical acceptance and cencellation rates, as well as order features, like pickup/dropoff locations, ETA and distance, in total there's 20+ features, If you need the list we can provide. Obviously not all features would have the same weight in the decision. 

