How it *should* be possible to test this error:

# Create a credit-card company and add *an Adyen test* credit card;
# Ask to whitelist your credit-card company for pre-auth [https://taxify.slack.com/archives/CNV6QPRFT/p1675424840248789|https://taxify.slack.com/archives/CNV6QPRFT/p1675424840248789|smart-link]; 
# Book a ride with upfront pricing and never finish it;
# Add a second credit card and make it primary;
# Try to delete the first credit card.

The problem is: after migration to the new credit card form, we are bound to *ProcessOut*, and this error is not implemented for this provider.

